  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Emergency Lifesaving Assistance to Flood Affected Population in Ethiopia through Cash and Shelter/Non-food Items Assistance</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The recent flooding and mudslides from heavy rainfall and overflowing rivers has exacerbated the already challenging conditions faced by crisis-affected communities in Ethiopia. The proposed assistance aims to address the immediate and essential needs of a total 79,804 individuals (14,510 households) through multi-purpose cash (MPCA) and emergency shelter/non-food item (SNFI) assistance.</narrative>
  </description>
